# K9 Atelier

Mobile pet grooming business. Website at k9atelier.com.

## Stack
- Next.js 15 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS v4
- Content source: `content/business.json`
- Deploy: GitHub `whee0593-sudo/K9-Atelier` → Vercel (auto on push to main)

## Brand
- Tagline: K9 ATELIER — grooming, elevated.
- Colors: cream `#FAF7F2`, lavender `#C8B8D8`, gold `#C4A882`, blue `#A8C4D4`
- Logo: `public/logo.png`
- Email: penny@k9atelier.com

## Business rules
- Booking: valid payment method required; **no charge at booking** (card on file via Stripe Setup Intent when built)
- Hours: Mon–Fri 9:00–16:00 (America/New_York)
- Service area: 10 mi free, then $6.50/mile one-way beyond, max 20 mi
- Over 45 lbs: hand stripping (no bath) + end-of-life care only

## User context
- Owner communicates in 中文 — explain technical terms in plain Chinese.
- **All customer-facing website copy must be in English** (UI, buttons, pages, emails unless explicitly requested otherwise).

## Conventions
- Minimal, elegant, static-clean visual design
- Minimize scope; match existing file patterns
- Update `content/business.json` when business data changes
- See `WORKBENCH.md` for links and workflow
